(a) MAJ_3 computable with <= 3 B_2 gates: False (so its circuit size is 4 (given the 4-gate formula))
(b) ln|F_(8,1)| = ln D_8* + ln Phi(2,1) = 17.4 nats (vs 65 as a 7-gate circuit, 193 as an 8-junta)
(c) MAJ_9: level-1 weight = 9 u_9^2 = 0.6729; Prop C1.5(1) with the 9 linear characters gives dis <= 0.327, whereas sgn(sum x_i) = MAJ_9 exactly
